WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.430
Crude oil comes out of the ground
as one thick, dark liquid.

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.330
Yet a refinery turns it into gases,

3
00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:11.850
runny fuels for cars and planes,
and thick, sticky sludges.

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.650
All of them were in the
crude oil from the start.

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.810
So how do you sort a liquid made
of so many different molecules?

6
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.150
In this mission, you'll find
out what crude oil is made of,

7
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.550
and meet the hydrocarbons inside it.

8
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.090
You'll see how a tall tower
separates them by boiling point,

9
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.510
and how the length of a molecule's
chain changes the way it

10
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.730
behaves.

11
00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.900
Your mission: explain how
a refinery sorts crude oil.
